## 🔥 Key Features

### 🛠️ For Workers
- **Browse Local Gigs**: Filter available tasks by category (Yard Work, Delivery, Handyman, Housekeeping, Tech Support, Pet Care).
- **Instant Escrow Locking**: Payments lock securely in Stripe escrow upon accepting a job.
- **GPS Check-In & Proof Upload**: Upload completion photo proof and notes directly.
- **Instant Payouts**: Instant cash-out to debit card or bank account powered by PayPal Hyperwallet.
- **Earnings & 1099 Summary**: Track total earnings, real-time transaction logs, and annual 1099-K tax reports.

### 💼 For Customers
- **Post a Job in Seconds**: Set task title, category, budget, location, required skills, and recurring schedule.
- **Secure Escrow Payments**: Customer funds held in escrow until job completion proof is reviewed and approved.
- **Worker Verification**: Review worker badges, rating scores, completed jobs, and background check verification status.
- **In-App Messaging**: Real-time direct chat between customers and workers.
- **Dispute Resolution Center**: Integrated dispute center for secure, guided support resolution.

