## 💻 How to Open & Build in Android Studio

1. **Clone or Download** this repository to your local machine.
2. Launch **Android Studio** (Jellyfish / Koala or newer recommended).
3. Select **Open** and choose the root folder of this project (`InstantCash`).
4. Allow Gradle to sync dependencies automatically.
5. Select an emulator or connected Android device and click **Run (Shift + F10)**.
